  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="1" para="true">LIBR.4. INSTIT. TIT.4.</l>
    <l n="2" type="heading" level="2" para="true">De Injuria.</l>
    <l n="3" para="true">In Princ. &amp; §. 1.</l>
    <l n="4" para="true">1. Injuria vocabulum quot modis acci-</l>
    <l n="5">piatur.</l>
    <l n="6" para="true">2. Injuria definitur.</l>
    <l n="7" para="true">§. 2. §. 6.</l>
    <l n="8" para="true">Quibus detur injuriarum actio, &amp; per</l>
    <l n="9">quos.</l>
    <l n="10" para="true">§. 3. 4.</l>
    <l n="11" para="true">Servis actio injuriarum non datur,</l>
    <l n="12">verum aliquando domino.</l>
    <l n="13" para="true">§. 7. 8.</l>
    <l n="14" para="true">Quae poena injuriarum.</l>
    <l n="15" para="true">§. 9.</l>
    <l n="16" para="true">Qua atrox qua levis injuria.</l>
    <l n="17" para="true">§. 10.</l>
    <l n="18" para="true">1. Injuriarum nomine &amp; civiliter &amp; cri-</l>
    <l n="19">minaliter agi potest, ut tamen si uno</l>
    <l n="20">modo actum sit, ad alterum recurrere</l>
    <l n="21">non liceat.</l>
    <l n="22" para="true">2. Quid jure Mosaico?</l>
    <l n="23" para="true">3. Quid moribus &amp; jure Canonum?</l>
    <l n="24" para="true">4. Quid jure feudali?</l>
    <l n="25" para="true">5. Per procuratorem quando &amp; quis cri-</l>
    <l n="26">minaliter agat vel defendatur?</l>
    <l n="27" para="true">6. Quid sit civiliter, quid criminaliter agere?</l>
    <l n="28" para="true">§. 11.</l>
    <l n="29" para="true">Injuriarum tenetur &amp; ille qui persua-</l>
    <l n="30">sit, qui mandavit, vel procuravit ut</l>
    <l n="31">alicui injuria fiat.</l>
    <l n="32" para="true">§. 12.</l>
    <l n="33" para="true">1. Modi quibus cessat vel tollitur injuria-</l>
    <l n="34">rum actio, recensentur.</l>
    <l n="35" para="true">2. Quid moribus?</l>
    <l n="36" para="true">3. Quid jure Canonico?</l>
    <l n="37" type="heading" level="1" para="true">LIBR.4. INSTIT. TIT.5.</l>
    <l n="38" type="heading" level="2" para="true">De obligationibus quae quasi ex delicto</l>
    <l n="39" type="heading" level="2">nascuntur.</l>
    <l n="40" para="true">In Princ.</l>
    <l n="41" para="true">1. Quid sit judicem litem suam fecisse. Quae sit in judicium deducenda re?</l>
    <l n="42" para="true">2. Ad quae sese extendat hoc quasi delictum?</l>
    <l n="43" para="true">3. Quid moribus?</l>
    <l n="44" para="true">4. Quid jure Canonum?</l>
    <l n="45" para="true">§. 1.</l>
    <l n="46" para="true">1. Qualis actio de dejectis &amp; effusis?</l>
    <l n="47" para="true">2. Moribus vulneris &amp; cicatricis habenda</l>
    <l n="48">ratio.</l>
    <l n="49" para="true">3. Qualis actio de suspensis &amp; positis.</l>
    <l n="50" para="true">§. 2.</l>
    <l n="51" para="true">Non tenetur pater ratione filii separa-</l>
    <l n="52">tim habitantis.</l>
    <l n="53" para="true">§. 3.</l>
    <l n="54" para="true">Quae sit exercitoria ab actione de re-</l>
    <l n="55">ceptis distincta?</l>
    <l n="56" type="heading" level="1" caput="6" para="true">LIBR. 4. INSTIT. TIT. 6.</l>
    <l n="57" type="heading" level="2" para="true">De Actionibus.</l>
    <l n="58" type="heading" level="2" para="true">In Princ.</l>
    <l n="59" para="true">1. Actionis materia commendatur.</l>
    <l n="60" para="true">2. Actionis vocabulum explicatur.</l>
    <l n="61" para="true">3. Incrementum juris circa actiones tradi-</l>
    <l n="62">tur.</l>
    <l n="63" para="true">4. Cujus juris sint actiones inquiritur.</l>
    <l n="64" para="true">6. Quibus non continetur accusatio.</l>
    <l n="65" para="true">§. 1.</l>
    <l n="66" para="true">1. Divisiones actionis proponuntur.</l>
    <l n="67" para="true">2. Actiones coram judice intentantur.</l>
    <l n="68" para="true">3. Quanam sint in personam actiones.</l>
    <l n="69" para="true">4. Quaenam actiones in rem.</l>
    <l n="70" para="true">§. 2.</l>
  </main_text>
